{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "178", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.07405254383377506, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Narrator/Instructor: Part three, you will hear two education students discussing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15360198182160828, "w": 0.8261894714459289, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "an assignment on teaching handwriting to children. First, you have some time to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.173922722295561, "w": 0.8260772066215126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "look at questions 21 to 24. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19424346276951368, "w": 0.8008219271759102, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Here is the transcript of the conversation between two education students,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22450213042880623, "w": 0.8260880742666159, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "presented in a conversation format, based on the provided sources:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2449711914181116, "w": 0.6909650038246934, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: How are you getting on with the assignment on handwriting?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2752669014848498, "w": 0.7371250700886215, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Student 2: Not too bad. You know, I hadn't realized that children benefit in so many", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.30552549370135734, "w": 0.8264365565845985, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "ways from learning to write. It's such an important skill and yet most people think", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3258462153146138, "w": 0.826142104917271, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "handwriting is less important than in the past because people hardly ever write by", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3463152763039192, "w": 0.8263385427287611, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hand these days.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.36663601677787183, "w": 0.18105435227143524, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: Yes. And all the evidence suggests children should learn to write by", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39689460899437934, "w": 0.8262763100818016, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "hand before they learn to type. Not least because it helps their memory.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41721534946833205, "w": 0.7334967632359459, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: That's right. The physical act of writing helps children to remember", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.44747397940623207, "w": 0.826096993937597, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "letters. That seems pretty obvious when you think about it. What's less obvious is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46796774790763207, "w": 0.8264896645106694, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "how it helps develop their concentration. They have to sit still and focus on one", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4882884883815848, "w": 0.8259684276455257, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "thing.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5087575493708901, "w": 0.068173891138799, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: Yeah, that aspect of handwriting had never occurred to me before.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5390161793087902, "w": 0.792758954708884, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Student 2: Same here. I'm not sure I understand how it improves children's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5692748092466902, "w": 0.8266867174718823, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "imagination though. Student 1: Well, there was that study which showed that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5895955497206429, "w": 0.8259247520152049, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "primary age children generated more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6099162524732031, "w": 0.38852264412265963, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ideas when they were writing by hand than using a keyboard. I would have guessed", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6401748824111031, "w": 0.8261642503072929, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that would be the case. Yeah, I'd never associated spatial awareness with", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6606809858078542, "w": 0.826529239142838, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "handwriting either. I thought spatial awareness was more to do with knowing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6810018017245919, "w": 0.8260336335161456, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "where you are in relation to objects or other people.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7013224667557596, "w": 0.533083546662131, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: I thought that too. But good spatial awareness is essential for writing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7317294549304048, "w": 0.8260721828987762, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "because you have to space words correctly. It's not just fine motor skills that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7520501954043575, "w": 0.8260452188359255, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "improve through writing as I'd always assumed.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7723709358783102, "w": 0.4903502231916982, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: Handwriting is so much harder for children with dyspraxia who have", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8026295280948177, "w": 0.8260267643442406, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "problems coordinating movement. It's good there are lots of things you can do in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.823098589084123, "w": 0.8267665844108962, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the classroom to help them. They need so much more support with letter", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8434193295580757, "w": 0.8258593410946774, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "formation. You need to play lots of games to help them distinguish letter shapes.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8637648152655156, "w": 0.8259248545401586, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It takes a lot of patience.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.884233876254821, "w": 0.26173364775686164, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: Yeah, I like the idea of using one of those pens that lights up if you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9144924684713285, "w": 0.8265538451317512, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "press too hard. That seems like a really simple solution.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9348132089452812, "w": 0.5711806917215099, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}